e him as well  along with scar who is the rightful heir  to the crown by right of birth and  considering that we all understand how  their relationship breaks down this  Narrative of Mufasa's early life could  everlastingly alter our preconceived  notions of him as well as scar Mufasa  The Lion King is scheduled to release as  a summer blockbuster in theaters July  5th 2024.  [Music]  thank you

